---
---

<section id="graphql-contrast">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label">The Solution</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Five systems. One query.</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">
      Stop stitching endpoints.
    </p>
    <p class="contrast-lede">
      Ask for the shape you need.<br />
      Resolve it in one place.
    </p>

    <div class="contrast-grid">
      <div class="contrast-arrow mono" aria-hidden="true">→ → →</div>
      <div class="contrast-col rest">
        <div class="contrast-head">
          <span class="contrast-label mono">REST</span>
          <span class="contrast-tag">5 calls · 5 shapes</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="code-block"><code>GET /parcels/:id
GET /zoning?parcel=...
GET /permits?parcel=...
GET /transit?near=...
GET /311?parcel=...

// client joins everything</code></pre>
      </div>

      <div class="contrast-col graphql">
        <div class="contrast-head">
          <span class="contrast-label mono accent">GraphQL</span>
          <span class="contrast-tag accent">1 call · 1 shape</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="code-block"><code>query BlockContext($id: ID!) &#123;
  parcel(id: $id) &#123;
    address
    zoning &#123; allowedUses &#125;
    permits &#123; status issuedAt &#125;
    nearbyTransit &#123; stops &#123; name &#125; &#125;
    complaints &#123; count openCount &#125;
  &#125;
&#125;</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="contrast-caption">
      GraphQL moves the join into the server.
    </p>
    <p class="contrast-closer">
      Same data. Same database.<br />
      What changes is where the <em>composition</em> happens.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contrast-grid {
    margin-top: 48px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .contrast-arrow {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--bg);
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    z-index: 2;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contrast-arrow {
      position: static;
      transform: none;
      text-align: center;
      display: block;
      padding: 4px 0;
    }
  }

  .contrast-col {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .contrast-col.graphql {
    border-color: var(--accent-dim);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--accent-dim);
  }

  .contrast-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  }

  .contrast-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .contrast-label.accent {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .contrast-tag {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .contrast-tag.accent {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .code-block {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text);
    padding: 20px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 0;
    white-space: pre;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .contrast-col.rest .code-block {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .contrast-lede {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .contrast-caption {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .contrast-closer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .contrast-closer em {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contrast-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .code-block {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
    }
  }
</style>
